{"availability":"available","full":"Aitherium/awdk","name":"awdk","description":"Build AI agent fleets. 3 lines, any backend, local or cloud. Effort-based model routing, 48 identities, knowledge graph memory, fleet orchestration.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":11,"forks":1,"created":"2026-03-15T19:52:46Z","updated":"2026-10-09T08:41:08Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://aitherium.github.io/awdk/","topics":[],"demo":"https://aitherium.github.io/awdk/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T08:57:00.687Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T08:57:00.687Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T08:57:00.687Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:50.480Z","stars":11,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-09T08:57:00.687Z","stars":11,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The Aither World is an operating system for agents — a Linux you can hand to one, the runtimes it works in, and the tools it works with. awnix is the Linux underneath it; awdk is one of its 67 bricks — each installs on its own, runs offline, and needs no account. Start here: Point it at a backend you already pay for and run one agent loop.","3 lines of code. Any backend. Local or cloud. Zero lock-in.","Aither ADK is a Python SDK + CLI for building AI agents that run on your hardware — a single helpful agent or a coordinated fleet that delegates work to each other. Agents get tools, persistent knowledge-graph memory, safety filtering, and effort-based model routing out of the box. Swap the LLM backend at runtime — your GPU, Ollama, llama.cpp, or any cloud API — same code, same agents."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Aitherium/awdk/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8608b5b7ffa29837fbcc49e695f85b535025c6ab8e769f6321efd38c9c2db115","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T16:45:16.654Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:45:16.654Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The Aither World is an o